stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> LOADING : screen focuses (useFocusEffect)

    LOADING --> SPLIT_VIEW : load() resolves
    LOADING --> EMPTY : no matches at all

    state SPLIT_VIEW {
        [*] --> Browsing
        Browsing --> Browsing : tap new match or conversation row
    }

    note right of SPLIT_VIEW
        Top strip: new matches with no messages yet.
        Bottom list: conversations sorted starred first.
    end note

    SPLIT_VIEW --> ChatScreen : openChat() navigates to /chat route

    note right of ChatScreen
        /chat route is planned but
        not yet implemented in the app.
    end note

    ChatScreen --> LOADING : back navigation re-focuses tab
